# Only our own code and docs go in git, not the DragonRuby SDK.
#
# Each game folder (1010/, tic-tac-toe/, ...) is a full copy of the SDK
# with the game in its mygame/ folder. So we ignore everything, then let
# back in each game's app/, tests/, README.md and screenshot.

# Everything at the top level: the SDK zip, dragonruby-macos/, .itch.toml, ...
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE

# Game folders: only mygame/, not the SDK binaries, docs, logs and tmp/
!/*/
/*/*
!/*/mygame/

# Inside mygame/: not the SDK template files (metadata/, fonts/, sounds/,
# sprites/, open-source-licenses.txt) or the save files in data/
/*/mygame/*
!/*/mygame/app/
!/*/mygame/tests/
!/*/mygame/README.md
!/*/mygame/screenshot.png

# The SDK's scratch file, left as shipped
/*/mygame/app/repl.rb

# The unzipped SDK itself (it has a mygame/ folder too)
/dragonruby-macos/

.DS_Store
